# NOTE (CI fix, 2026-10-17): gradlew / gradlew.bat / gradle-wrapper.jar
# are INTENTIONALLY committed (NOT ignored). The Flutter template used
# to ignore them, which meant a `git ls-files`-based upload left the
# Gradle wrapper out of the GitHub repo. `flutter build apk` happens
# to regenerate the wrapper, so that alone did not break the GitHub
# build — but a self-contained repo (wrapper included) removes a whole
# class of CI failure and matches what `flutter create` produces on disk.
/.gradle
/captures/
/local.properties
GeneratedPluginRegistrant.java
.cxx/

# Remember to never publicly share your keystore.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
